prompt = "Read the captain's log"
title = "CAPTAIN'S LOG"
entries = PackedStringArray("Day 3 in Berth E2. Clamp drill: 41 s from capture box to hard dock. The yard says 35. The yard has never docked a frigate.", "Port nacelle grille recalibrated. Ops swears the starboard one hums a quarter tone sharp. It does.", "Reminder to all hands: the synthesizer is not a coffee machine. It is also not NOT a coffee machine.", "Shield drill passed. If the bubble lights up on a pier approach, you came in too fast. Everyone did, once.")

